            {
                "entry_id": "aa49e33d-572d-3255-8be8-bd676f95e7ff",
                "word": "pro-choix",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5524593b-9416-3f65-b54f-f53af7640482",
                        "entry_id": "aa49e33d-572d-3255-8be8-bd676f95e7ff",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est pour l’autorisation ou la légalisation de l’avortement ou de l’euthanasie."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "098fcbc5-d323-4ff6-9323-068fc34c5428",
                                "sense_id": "5524593b-9416-3f65-b54f-f53af7640482",
                                "text": "Les pouvoirs publics n’ayant aucune raison d’interdire la « marche pour la vie », les féministes ont décidé d’organiser leur propre manifestation pro-choix."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "0e46645a-a460-36a1-8f30-79167eb34d30",
                "word": "pro-choix",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4b963697-c314-3ebc-b189-78246399478c",
                        "entry_id": "0e46645a-a460-36a1-8f30-79167eb34d30",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne qui veut autoriser ou légaliser l’avortement ou l’euthanasie."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8ad5fea-8f4b-4718-a589-b13a81829d0e",
                                "sense_id": "4b963697-c314-3ebc-b189-78246399478c",
                                "text": "Je n'appellerais pas ce mouvement «pro-vie», mais plutôt «contre-avortement». Mais j'en conviens, ce n'est pas un terme très «marketing» d'être «contre-quelque-chose». C'est bien plus joli de se dire pro-vie. C’est à ce tournant précis que je deviens pro-choix, dans ce débat spécifique contre l’avortement."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "24a2665d-782f-4dc7-8b80-0d6bcc96e9ea",
                        "source_entry_id": "0e46645a-a460-36a1-8f30-79167eb34d30",
                        "source_sense_id": "4b963697-c314-3ebc-b189-78246399478c",
                        "target_lang_word": "pro-choice",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pro-choice",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "04a77fd1-149e-3b28-9580-f9aa7b078449",
                                        "entry_id": "0b868fff-739a-35d6-a7d8-e9ae6af8c1cf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Supportive of a person's right to choose whether or not to have an abortion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2fd476e4-e007-49d7-8b3b-4cc8e14746c4",
                                                "sense_id": "04a77fd1-149e-3b28-9580-f9aa7b078449",
                                                "text": "When I defend my pro-choice position in the debate over abortion in our country, I frequently refer to Romania, where pregnancy could be monitored on behalf of the state, and to China, where it could be forcibly terminated."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d3882cf-a1e6-4368-9d4a-3b4cf7be80ad",
                                                "sense_id": "04a77fd1-149e-3b28-9580-f9aa7b078449",
                                                "text": "But if past is prologue, it’s hard to predict what our prochoice Republican governor will do. […] “You’re totally prochoice and bipartisan,” Caroline says in the ad, as they sit together on a park bench surrounded by trees and grass."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c26583e-af44-32bc-beb3-fab39c27dece",
                                        "entry_id": "0b868fff-739a-35d6-a7d8-e9ae6af8c1cf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Supportive of a person's right to choose whether or not to end their life by euthanasia."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d19110f4-1120-475a-bde0-2e71e93ac066",
                                                "sense_id": "2c26583e-af44-32bc-beb3-fab39c27dece",
                                                "text": "These cases help create and sustain an essentially pro-choice regime, at least with respect to passive euthanasia and arguably with respect to physician-assisted suicide as well."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c640efcd-c112-44a7-8926-27b28908497a",
                                                "sense_id": "2c26583e-af44-32bc-beb3-fab39c27dece",
                                                "text": "Two other sites worthy of note are http://www.efn.org/~ergo/ (Pro-Choice) and http://www.euthanasia.com (Pro-Life)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a618c0a2-af7f-403d-9f5a-58f79a3a4583",
                                                "sense_id": "2c26583e-af44-32bc-beb3-fab39c27dece",
                                                "text": "Whether we are pro-choice on euthanasia or anti-euthanasia, we can all agree that leaving patients in pain is abhorrent, ethically, and morally reprehensible, and should be punished severely by the law."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "135ccbb0-cbb3-329d-b5fa-6d9c1c96c822",
                                        "entry_id": "0b868fff-739a-35d6-a7d8-e9ae6af8c1cf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Supportive in general of a person's right to choose; supportive of self-determination, bodily integrity, and individual sovereignty."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26348998-a2c0-4c67-bbc1-96c928175f86",
                                                "sense_id": "135ccbb0-cbb3-329d-b5fa-6d9c1c96c822",
                                                "text": "Individualism, self-determination, and pro-choice rhetorics are additional cultural discourses that play into this experience as well: the ability to make your own choices in life and to be able to succeed with those choices is the quintessential American dream."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
